      "content": "Thanks for that. Could you go into a bit more detail regarding the wear and tear specifically? I'm worried about things like scuff marks from heavy shoes or small scratches that might show up over time in a high-traffic area. Which of those three would be the most problematic if the surface starts getting nicked or scratched up?",
